    {
      "id": "FR-005",
      "title": "Lint reports a body-only \u0060Blocked by:\u0060 declaration when the authoritative field is empty and a divergent projection when their canonical sets differ, while an agreeing generated projection stays green. Invalid body syntax is reported rather than promoted to authority. (Stories: US-002; Acceptance: AC-005)",
      "text": "Lint reports a body-only \u0060Blocked by:\u0060 declaration when the authoritative field is empty and a divergent projection when their canonical sets differ, while an agreeing generated projection stays green. Invalid body syntax is reported rather than promoted to authority. (Stories: US-002; Acceptance: AC-005)",
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
