    {
      "id": "FR-006",
      "title": "Focused tests and gate inversion prove add preserves \u0060#290\u0060 while adding \u0060#299\u0060, remove preserves \u0060#299\u0060 while removing \u0060#290\u0060, batch, release, and deferred \u0060flush\u0060 replay cannot bypass an active derived writer\u0027s lease, a contended replay stays queued without mutation, a changed observation is never overwritten, and lint distinguishes inert, divergent, invalid, absent, and agreeing body projections. (Stories: US-001, US-002; Acceptance: AC-006)",
      "text": "Focused tests and gate inversion prove add preserves \u0060#290\u0060 while adding \u0060#299\u0060, remove preserves \u0060#299\u0060 while removing \u0060#290\u0060, batch, release, and deferred \u0060flush\u0060 replay cannot bypass an active derived writer\u0027s lease, a contended replay stays queued without mutation, a changed observation is never overwritten, and lint distinguishes inert, divergent, invalid, absent, and agreeing body projections. (Stories: US-001, US-002; Acceptance: AC-006)",
