    {
      "id": "DEC-002",
      "title": "Put every authoritative \u0060Blocked by\u0060 mutation route behind \u0060Writes.withBlockedByMutationLease\u0060, acquired before observation and held through mutation. The shared lease covers add/remove, explicit replacement/clear, \u0060set-field --batch\u0060, \u0060release --blocked-by\u0060, intake, reconcile, and \u0060Board.flush\u0060 replay. Flush retains an entry when contention or transport uncertainty prevents a known mutation, drops it only when replay is known to have landed, and never re-appends it. Keep \u0060Board.boardWriteGuarded\u0060 as a secondary detector: it accepts \u0060BlockedByObservation\u0060, re-reads immediately before mutation, and emits no mutation on mismatch. Fixtures control observations, the issue-comment lease, and the deferred queue independently, assert a stale diagnostic plus zero update/clear documents on mismatch, and assert that a lower-ID contender fences batch/release/flush without any board mutation.",
      "decision": "Put every authoritative \u0060Blocked by\u0060 mutation route behind \u0060Writes.withBlockedByMutationLease\u0060, acquired before observation and held through mutation. The shared lease covers add/remove, explicit replacement/clear, \u0060set-field --batch\u0060, \u0060release --blocked-by\u0060, intake, reconcile, and \u0060Board.flush\u0060 replay. Flush retains an entry when contention or transport uncertainty prevents a known mutation, drops it only when replay is known to have landed, and never re-appends it. Keep \u0060Board.boardWriteGuarded\u0060 as a secondary detector: it accepts \u0060BlockedByObservation\u0060, re-reads immediately before mutation, and emits no mutation on mismatch. Fixtures control observations, the issue-comment lease, and the deferred queue independently, assert a stale diagnostic plus zero update/clear documents on mismatch, and assert that a lower-ID contender fences batch/release/flush without any board mutation.",
      "requirementRefs": [
        "FR-003"
      ],
      "storyRefs": [],
      "acceptanceRefs": [
        "AC-003"
      ],
      "source": "work/2907-blocked-by-set-mutations/clarifications.md",
      "sourceLocation": {
        "line": 27,
        "column": 1
      },
      "linkedTaskIds": [
        "T008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEC-003",
      "title": "Parse only an unfenced, line-leading \u0060Blocked by:\u0060 body projection using the same dependency canonicalizer as the field. No body line means no finding. A present line with empty authoritative field yields \u0060BLOCKED-BY-BODY-INERT\u0060; unequal canonical sets or invalid projection syntax yield the same stable rule family with a precise divergent/invalid detail; equal canonical sets stay green.",
      "decision": "Parse only an unfenced, line-leading \u0060Blocked by:\u0060 body projection using the same dependency canonicalizer as the field. No body line means no finding. A present line with empty authoritative field yields \u0060BLOCKED-BY-BODY-INERT\u0060; unequal canonical sets or invalid projection syntax yield the same stable rule family with a precise divergent/invalid detail; equal canonical sets stay green.",
      "requirementRefs": [
        "FR-005"
      ],
      "storyRefs": [],
      "acceptanceRefs": [
        "AC-005"
      ],
      "source": "work/2907-blocked-by-set-mutations/clarifications.md",
      "sourceLocation": {
        "line": 28,
        "column": 1
      },
      "linkedTaskIds": [
        "T009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEC-004",
      "title": "Mutation controls independently replace union with requested-only, subtraction with empty, bypass the shared lease from an authoritative direct route, bypass it from deferred \u0060flush\u0060 replay, and replace stale comparison with unconditional success; lint controls suppress the body comparison. Each control must red a named focused test, then be restored before the full gates.",
      "decision": "Mutation controls independently replace union with requested-only, subtraction with empty, bypass the shared lease from an authoritative direct route, bypass it from deferred \u0060flush\u0060 replay, and replace stale comparison with unconditional success; lint controls suppress the body comparison. Each control must red a named focused test, then be restored before the full gates.",
      "requirementRefs": [
        "FR-006"
      ],
